    "detailed_description": "Enjoy basketball with easy to learn controls!<br>Enjoy all kinds of stages! From factories to amusement parks!<br>Customize your team and dunk on your friends!<br><br>[Practice Game]<br>Experience exciting matches in single player!<br>Play games 3v3 or 5v5.<br>Learn the rules and controls as you go!<br><br>[Friendly Game]<br>Play competitively or cooperatively with up to 4 people!<br>Play on a normal court or on special courts loaded with fun gimmicks!<br>Use these gimmicks to your advantage to defeat your opponent!<br><br>[Team Selection]<br>Use items to increase your player's stats or to find your own unique play style!<br>Customize your team's uniforms and make your dream team!<br><br>[Tournament]<br>Take on the Championship Cup!<br>Battle against strong rivals and seize victory!<br><br>[Capsule Shoot]<br>Use the points you've gained from playing different modes to get new formations, uniforms, and rare items to take your play to the next level!<br><br>[Mini Game]<br>Use Point Shooter to rack up points with accurate shooting!",
